Hi all,

I talked to James yesterday and we agreed that we should have the weekly
developer/community meeting on Thursdays at 19:00 UTC (starting
tomorrow). The idea is to keep the meetings pretty informal, but discuss
specific issues when necessary. Given this short notice I can't promise
James is attending but I'll ask him. Andrew, Patel and I will be there,
though.

As said, the next meeting is tomorrow:

Place: #openvpn-discussion at irc.freenode.net
Time: Thursday Jan 28th 19:00 UTC (20:00 MET, 21:00 EEST, 11AM PST, 2PM EST)
Duration: ~60 min
Topics:

 - Community site Trac environment (how to build support for multiple
projects)
 - Trac plugins to use
 - Trac theming
 - Forum software and integration to Trac
 - The "user wiki"
   - How to avoid ending up with a user wiki with developer content and
vice versa?
   - Should we have only one wiki after all?
 - Whatever else comes up

